</article>
<p>
<article class="env-lemma" id="0429">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/0429">Lemma <span data-tag="0429">74.11.26</span>.</a> The property $\mathcal{P}(f) =$“$f$ is smooth” is fpqc local on the base. </p>
