<p>
<article class="env-lemma" id="042B">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/042B">Lemma <span data-tag="042B">74.11.28</span>.</a> The property $\mathcal{P}(f) =$“$f$ is étale” is fpqc local on the base. </p>
